                    \\,.
            %p
              This follows by observing that the functor of precomposion with the inclusion
              %a.maruku-eqref{:href => "#eq:FullInclusionOfConnectedComponents"} (1)
            .maruku-equation
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "block", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %msup
                      %mi ι
